   2)Enable option "Block All The Clients DNS Traffic";;
   3)Run tool DNS2TCP on LAN PC;
  4)After about 5 mins, check "Detected Suspicious Clients Information" table and tunnel connectivity;
   5)Check Block checkbox status of all detected clients;
   6)Run nslookup on this LAN PC,check DNS traffic;
   7)Disable the Block checkbox of  one selected client;
    8)Check tunnel connectivity of this client;
   9)Check logs;
   10)Run nslookup on this client.
   Enable the Block checkbox on this selected client again, repeat step 8-10

25.result:
in step 3, traffic transfer succeed between LAN PC and server;
