   in step 5, Block checkbox should be enabled on all detected clients;
   in step 6, DNS traffic failed;
   in step 8, after disable the block checkbox, DNS tunnel connectivity will be restored;
   in step 9, logs generated: Find DNS tunnel attack.
   in step 10, dns traffic will not be blocked anymore.
   in step 11, dns tunnel will be blocked and logs generated:
Find DNS tunnel attack and
Drop DNS Packets Via Suspicious DNS Tunnel;
All DNS traffic send from dns tunnel client will be blocked

